  },
  {
   "id": "title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -120,
   "width": 2580,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# 5e — Undo 1 entry Snapshot — RestoreSnapshot (destroy + spawn lại)\nNguồn: [[Architecture_Map]] Phần 5 (tự sinh, đừng sửa tay). **Đi theo mũi tên 1 → 2 → 3… = đi theo thời gian.** Mũi tên **xanh lá + ✓K2** = đã kiểm chứng K2 · **xám** = theo doc · **đỏ + ?** = chưa rõ. Dòng nhỏ cuối thẻ = ai gọi. Thẻ vàng = nhánh ngược lại / ghi chú."
  },
  {
   "id": "h_UM",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 25,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[BP_UndoManager]]",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_IM",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[BP_FurnitureInputManager]]",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_FA",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[BP_FurnitureActor]]\n(mỗi món)",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_MC",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[WBP_MeshControls]]",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_INV",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[WBP_FurnitureInventory]]",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h_MSS",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 140,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "### [[MaterialSlotService_Reference]]",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 25,
   "y": 280,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "**1.** đọc entry ở CurrentIndex → Snapshot → CurrentIndex−1\n`RestoreSnapshot(N−1, PreviousActor)`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#RestoreSnapshot(IndexHistory, PreviousActor) — v1.10 hợp nhất spawn path qua SpawnFurnitureCopy|BP_UndoManager › RestoreSnapshot]]\n<small>nội bộ · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 532,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**2.** bỏ chọn tất cả\n`DeselectAll()`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureInputManager#DeselectAll (T5 → v1.6)|BP_FurnitureInputManager › DeselectAll]]\n<small>Step 1 doc · ← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 762,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 256,
   "text": "**3.** báo tin\n`OnSelectionChanged([], None) → OnMeshSelected (Cancel seam, bỏ Target)`\n↗ [[WBP_FurnitureInventory#OnMeshSelected(SelectedActor) — handler nội bộ — SỬA (Save As/Save đè T2, node-verified K2Node 03/08/2026)|WBP_FurnitureInventory › OnMeshSelected]]\n<small>← BP_FurnitureInputManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 25,
   "y": 1058,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 146,
   "text": "**4.** xoá hết đồ\n`Destroy All Actors tag \"FurnitureSpawned\"`\n<small>Step 2 doc · nội bộ · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 1244,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 300,
   "text": "↻ lặp: 4. mỗi món trong ảnh\n**5.** spawn lại, không tự chọn, không nhồi Recent\n`SpawnFurnitureCopy(bAutoSelect=False, bAddToRecent=False)`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureInputManager#SpawnFurnitureCopy(...) → NewActorCopy — FULL NODE FLOW ( ✓K2 export 21/09/2026 — U1 prep + ✓ensure PersistentID chèn 21/09/2026, U1.2 )|BP_FurnitureInputManager › SpawnFurnitureCopy]]\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 1584,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 234,
   "text": "↻ lặp: 4. mỗi món trong ảnh\n**6.** bắt đầu tải mesh (async)\n`LoadMeshAsync()`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureActor#LoadMeshAsync(MeshPath String) — Custom Event — SỬA 07/09/2026 (S7.G3, fix race)|BP_FurnitureActor › LoadMeshAsync]]\n<small>← BP_FurnitureInputManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 1858,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 124,
   "text": "↻ lặp: 4. mỗi món trong ảnh\n**7.** gắn lại mã đồ\n`SET RowName`\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · ✓K2</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 905,
   "y": 2022,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 168,
   "text": "↻ lặp: 4. mỗi món trong ảnh\n**8.** gắn lại nhóm + danh tính + slot\n`SET GroupID · PersistentID (guard) · MaterialSlots`\n<small>← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 2230,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "**9.** chọn lại đồ trong ảnh\n`SelectActors(RestoredActors) → viền + gizmo + OnSelectionChanged`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureInputManager#SelectActors(Actors) (T5)|BP_FurnitureInputManager › SelectActors]]\n<small>Step 5 doc · ← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 2482,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "**10.** khôi phục nhóm + edit mode\n`SET Groups, EditModeStack → ValidateEditMode()`\n↗ [[BP_UndoManager#ValidateEditMode() — v1.7 MỚI|BP_UndoManager › ValidateEditMode]]\n<small>Step 5b doc · ← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1345,
   "y": 2734,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**11.** nút mode theo ảnh\n`RefreshButtonState(ActiveMode) ?`\n↗ [[WBP_MeshControls#RefreshButtonState(ActiveMode)|WBP_MeshControls › RefreshButtonState]]\n<small>Step 6 doc · ← BP_UndoManager · chưa rõ ?</small>",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 465,
   "y": 2964,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**12.** chọn lại lần nữa cho info bar\n`SelectActors() (lần 2 → lý do B-gizmo)`\n↗ [[BP_FurnitureInputManager#SelectActors(Actors) (T5)|BP_FurnitureInputManager › SelectActors]]\n<small>Step 6b doc · ← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 3194,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 234,
   "text": "**13.** báo tin\n`Broadcast OnRestoreCompleted(RestoredBPActor) → OnSceneRestored`\n↗ [[WBP_FurnitureInventory#OnSceneRestored(RestoredSelectedActor) — v1.1 + SỬA (Replace UX Fix P4.3, 02/08/2026)|WBP_FurnitureInventory › OnSceneRestored]]\n<small>Step 7 doc · ← BP_UndoManager · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1785,
   "y": 3468,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 212,
   "text": "**14.** hẹn 0.1s\n`Timer → ApplyRestoredActor() → RefreshSlotSwatches + RefreshParamPanel()`\n↗ [[WBP_FurnitureInventory#ApplyRestoredActor — v1.2 (T4 18/09 Equal-guard + seam 6 RefreshParamPanel)|WBP_FurnitureInventory › ApplyRestoredActor]]\n<small>nội bộ · theo doc</small>"
  },
  {
   "id": "n21",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 3720,
   "width": 1660,
   "height": 70,
   "text": "📝 vài frame sau (async): LoadMeshAsync.Completed → RestoreMyMaterialSlots → Rst_LoadNextSlot từng slot",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2225,
   "y": 3830,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 278,
   "text": "**15.** gắn lại vật liệu + thông số từng slot\n`ApplyLoadedMaterialToSlot() → ApplyParamsJsonToSlot()`\n↗ [[MaterialSlotService_Reference#ApplyLoadedMaterialToSlot(Mesh, Records&, SlotName, HintIndex, LoadedMI, RowName, PathFallback) → bool|MaterialSlotService_Reference › ApplyLoadedMaterialToSlot]]\n<small>← BP_FurnitureActor · theo doc</small>"
  }
 ],
